   0,                                             !- North Axis
   Suburbs,                                       !- Terrain
    .04,                                          !- Loads Convergence Tolerance
    .4,                                           !- Temperature Convergence Tolerance
   FullExterior,                                  !- Solar Distribution
   25,                                            !- Maximum number of warmup days
